# EmailJS — contact form delivery to ayan48311@gmail.com
# Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com, add an email service + template,
# then copy the three public identifiers here. All three are safe to expose client-side.
# Without them the contact form falls back to a mailto: link instead of failing.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
